norm article 10 digital publication has the legal text "Member States shall ensure that reports and data resulting from environmental assessments and screening procedures, related decisions and monitoring of environmental effects and procedures are made and remain publicly available in a digital format through a central online portal, in a manner that is compatible with the preservation of business secrets and Union or national data protection requirements. That portal shall be based on a digital geographic information system and shall include all available data on species observations and other environmental and geological data. (after twelve months from entry into force).".

